{"1879270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Into the Crypt", "steam_appid": 1879270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solo and Co-op Deckbuilding!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in first-person and play cards to interact with the environment. Cards and keys can be used to unlock doors, chests, and breakable treasures in the Crypt. Play alone or with a friend and explore the crypt together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/extras/1640469a8039b3d532050de20ee6753d.poster.avif?t=1787182297\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/extras/1640469a8039b3d532050de20ee6753d.webm?t=1787182297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/extras/1640469a8039b3d532050de20ee6753d.mp4?t=1787182297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep Card Interactions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck from hundreds of unique cards and dozens of status effects. Discover synergies between cards, chain complex combos,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/extras/0389da5f973f254d7a67fd62bac7d377.poster.avif?t=1787182297\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/extras/0389da5f973f254d7a67fd62bac7d377.webm?t=1787182297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/extras/0389da5f973f254d7a67fd62bac7d377.mp4?t=1787182297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Class-Driven Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master one of several distinct classes. Each class has their own unique deck of cards and additional mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/extras/963e1abdb7f3d18fc4ef28f6cf32baa5.avif?t=1787182297\" width=780 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <strong>Berserker</strong> - Generate and spend Fury as a second resource, unlock a special card when reaching threshold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alchemist</strong> - Brew unique potions during combat. Collect ingredients and form concoctions. <br> <br><strong>Druid</strong> - Call upon your allies (Sheaf &amp; Gob) to assist you in battle. Each ally has its own diverse set of abilities and actions. <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Encounter Devastating Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your strategy to face over 120 challenging enemies, most of which have one or more abilities that will force you to rethink your card-playing decisions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/extras/7e0bb04ae5e8a746510b961f35d6808c.avif?t=1787182297\" width=780 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/extras/bba316115edec94a09115c47cc2995f0.avif?t=1787182297\" width=780 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/extras/1ed6fdf3a10dc97ea437bd5c2ff47a0d.poster.avif?t=1787182297\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/extras/1ed6fdf3a10dc97ea437bd5c2ff47a0d.webm?t=1787182297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/extras/1ed6fdf3a10dc97ea437bd5c2ff47a0d.mp4?t=1787182297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rich Progression System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every descent into the crypt is unique. Procedurally-generated maps with branching paths, a variety of encounter types, including secret encounters that keeps you at arm's length from imminent death! <br> <br> Make pivotal choices in event encounters, experience witty and ominous creatures in your journey through the Crypt, and find new ways of staying alive. No two runs ever play the same. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/extras/9d76787de2288d1f3a4c185b7c1e73ae.poster.avif?t=1787182297\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/extras/9d76787de2288d1f3a4c185b7c1e73ae.webm?t=1787182297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/extras/9d76787de2288d1f3a4c185b7c1e73ae.mp4?t=1787182297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Featuring</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 300 unique cards and effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 enemies to encounter that have their own passive abilities, playing cards, and unique playstyle personalities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 200 items (potions, artifacts, secrets) to help you explore the Crypt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 75 engaging and choice-filled Events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique mechanics baked into deckbuilding, such as key cards and ally assists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three floors to conquer which are fully procedurally generated so no two runs feel the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in many different encounter types, some hidden and waiting to be discovered.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Endless Crypt' mode where enemies are relentless and combat never ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Crypt awaits you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/extras/74c5da87c514b50be04e200fffe29a1e.poster.avif?t=1787182297\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/extras/74c5da87c514b50be04e200fffe29a1e.webm?t=1787182297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/extras/74c5da87c514b50be04e200fffe29a1e.mp4?t=1787182297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solo and Co-op Deckbuilding!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in first-person and play cards to interact with the environment. Cards and keys can be used to unlock doors, chests, and breakable treasures in the Crypt. Play alone or with a friend and explore the crypt together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/extras/1640469a8039b3d532050de20ee6753d.poster.avif?t=1787182297\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/extras/1640469a8039b3d532050de20ee6753d.webm?t=1787182297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/extras/1640469a8039b3d532050de20ee6753d.mp4?t=1787182297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep Card Interactions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck from hundreds of unique cards and dozens of status effects. Discover synergies between cards, chain complex combos,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/extras/0389da5f973f254d7a67fd62bac7d377.poster.avif?t=1787182297\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/extras/0389da5f973f254d7a67fd62bac7d377.webm?t=1787182297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/extras/0389da5f973f254d7a67fd62bac7d377.mp4?t=1787182297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Class-Driven Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master one of several distinct classes. Each class has their own unique deck of cards and additional mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/extras/963e1abdb7f3d18fc4ef28