conquer which are fully procedurally generated so no two runs feel the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in many different encounter types, some hidden and waiting to be discovered.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Endless Crypt' mode where enemies are relentless and combat never ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Crypt awaits you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/extras/74c5da87c514b50be04e200fffe29a1e.poster.avif?t=1787182297\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/extras/74c5da87c514b50be04e200fffe29a1e.webm?t=1787182297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/extras/74c5da87c514b50be04e200fffe29a1e.mp4?t=1787182297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Immerse yourself in solo or co-op first-person deckbuilding where cards are your only weapon. Build complex synergies and use cards to physically unlock doors, chests, and interact with the environment while fighting to survive the crypt's powerful and strange enemies.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/86d369e93bff9c90d9869baacd3662e68c67e9e7/header.jpg?t=1787182297", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/c82dbfe769b574f5dd5d01ac15f52040aac38f36/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787182297", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879270/c82dbfe769b574f5dd5d01a